<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns two secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns two secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has assigned the first two of four credit auctions whereby it sought to inject 6.471 billion pesos in the secondary market.</p>
<p>The credits were offered or assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM    AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>1.736  bln pesos  7 days  28.50 pct</p>
<p>1.735  bln pesos  3 days  28.38 pct</p>
<p>1.500  bln pesos  2 days</p>
<p>1.500  bln pesos  1 day</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
